'''Bewilder Forest''' (Japanese: '''{{tt|迷|まよ}}いの{{tt|森|もり}}''' ''Bewilder Forest'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive [[forest]] in the [[Sinnoh]] [[region]]. It is located between [[Sandgem Town]] and [[Jubilife City]]. Bewilder Forest is notorious for its {{p|Stantler}} population, who often disorientate travelers using the illusion-inducing powers from their antlers.

This location was featured in ''[[DP006|Different Strokes for Different Blokes]]''. {{Ash}}'s [[rival]] [[Paul]] {{pkmn2|caught}} two {{OBP|Pokémon|species}} here: an {{TP|Paul|Ursaring}} and a Stantler. Stantler was {{pkmn2|released}} soon after its capture as Paul was unimpressed by its strength, but Ursaring remains on his [[party]].

Ash also fought in a {{pkmn|battle}} against Paul. Ash's somewhat mistrusting {{AP|Turtwig}} began to obey his commands during the match, but ultimately, Turtwig was defeated by [[Paul's Chimchar]].

